<title>USA: Hewitt, Texas, won by Service Asset.</title>
<headline>Hewitt, Texas, won by Service Asset.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Service Asset Management Co. said it won $1 million of Hewitt, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.133 percent.</p>
</text>
